  "description": "Provides enterprise-grade SQL Server integration for TuanZi applications with:\n\t\t\t- Full-featured SQL Server EF Core provider implementation\n\t\t\t- Support for all SQL Server data types (including spatial and JSON)\n\t\t\t- Optimized connection pooling and resiliency\n\t\t\t- SQL Server-specific performance optimizations\n\t\t\t- Comprehensive migration and schema management\n\t\t\t- Compatibility with SQL Server 2012 and later versions\n\t\t\t- Integration with TuanZi's repository and unit-of-work patterns\n\t\t\t- Support for Always Encrypted and other security features",
